      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Five cases of porokeratosis are reported. Two of these were of the classical mibelli type,in one case only one segment of the limb was involved in a linear fashion, in the fourth case a linear lesion involved the entire left side of the body, and the fifth case was of the disseminated superficial type. Typical histopathological features were observed in porokeratosis of Mibelli and also in the case of disseminated superficial type. In one case short contact dithranol and isotretinoic acid treatment was successful."},
